 " (2008). ",
 StyleBox["A Student's Guide to Maxwell's Equations",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 ". Cambridge University Press. Flux for Gauss's law, circulation for Amp\
\[EGrave]re's law \[LongDash] the reading the Rung 1 figure follows."
